# ipxe-config/general.h is iPXE build configuration, not source this
# repository compiles. The Earthfile copies it into a fresh upstream clone at
# ipxe/src/config/local/general.h and iPXE's own build includes it from there.
#
# Left detectable it is the only C in the repository, and CodeQL default setup
# answers that by adding a c-cpp analysis. That analysis cannot run: the
# buildless extractor indexes one header file and no translation unit, and
# exits with "Extraction failed: No source files found".
#
# See kairos-io/kairos#5365.
ipxe-config/** linguist-vendored
